  <Sequence sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText="- Overview&#xA;Set Values on a Grid Selector where item types consisting of TextBox, ComboBox, CheckBox, RadioButton.&#xA;&#xA;-Input/Output&#xA;in_TargetSelector as Input Fields Selector &lt;DataRow&gt; &#xA;in_TargetValue as Input Values &lt;DataRow[]&gt; &#xA;in_NullException as True : Throw an Exception    &#xA;                                   False : Do not throw an Exception &lt;Boolean&gt;&#xA;in_StartIndex as Start Index of the TargetValue DataRow &lt;int32&gt;&#xA;in_EndIndex as End Index of the TargetValue DataRow &lt;int32&gt;&#xA;in_DelayTime as Activity DelayBefore and DelayAfter value &lt;int32&gt;&#xA;out_dt_Selectors as table item selector data (Spread Screen) &lt;DataTable&gt;" DisplayName="SRC_SetGridValues" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="Sequence_7">
